      <title>The Indian Central Bank's Rupee Rescue Is Getting Desperate</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-13/the-indian-central-bank-s-rupee-rescue-is-getting-desperate</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b2c2f38acb41a832bc752ce2</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:30:50 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The Indian central bank seems to be in crisis-fighting mode. It has dusted off the playbook it last used during the 2013 taper tantrum to ward off a free fall in the currency. But the more desperate the defense of the psychologically important level of 100 rupees to the dollar, the greater the risk that authorities will overplay their hand and cause serious damage.</description>
